{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c92a1b5d260e2008","name":"Electrum Detail","source":{"id":"source:reference-c92a1b5d260e2008","title":"Electrum Detail","revision":20404,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:47:03Z","sha256":"4b149af33944b59edede5939c3dc46f4809ff60f2497022b3cbbd82b03028f9f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20404","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Electrum%20Detail&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c92a1b5d260e2008","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," accessory generally allowed only to high-ranking members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},", Electrum Detailing is usually a prestigious honor bestowed upon Jedi Masters as a sign of their rank and skill. A purely cosmetic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Accessory"},", Electrum Detail decorates the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," handle with the rare metal Electrum, giving it a distinctive gold color. Though Electrum Detail does not modify the mechanics of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," in any way, having a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," with Electrum Detail grants ",{"tag":"a","children":["Favorable Circumstances"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Favorable_Circumstances"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks against all targets familiar with the Electrum Detail tradition.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
